  "description": "The native payload for Agora's content moderation extension (full-content-inspect 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. Samples the outgoing video and classifies it on-device, for apps that must moderate what their users broadcast. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.EnableContentInspect in the RTC binding.",
